abstract: >-
  Provenance-grounded selective assurance for borehole database ingestion.
  The package freezes the Paper 4 manuscript, supplementary methods, vector
  artwork, structured result-level inputs, claim-evidence audits, and
  deterministic recomputation scripts. The separate data-v002 companion has
  mixed source-specific rights and is not represented as a blanket licence.
